<title>FRANCE: Rhone falls after share placement.</title>
<headline>Rhone falls after share placement.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Rhone-Poulenc were down 2.93 percent at 179.10 francs at 0943 GMT on Thursday after the CDR consortium sold 14.9 million shares.</p>
<p>The shares earlier hit a low of 178.20 francs.</p>
<p>Fund managers said the placement was executed at 177.50 francs per share.</p>
</text>
